  "notes": "Modified cash basis city. Governmental lines from the Total Governmental Funds column (p5); beginning/ending cash are the governmental fund balances it rolls forward (2,210,372 / 1,580,729), which include notes receivable and interfund balances. Governmental transfers are printed only as a net line 'Transfers From (To) Other Funds' (810,015) out, all to the Utilities Fund (p7). Business-type from the Proprietary Fund Statement of Revenues, Expenses and Changes in Net Position (p7, accrual-style: depreciation, capital assets, bonds), measure net position (1,881,794 -> 3,146,518); the government-wide business-type column (p1-3) is cash-based (1,520,224 -> 2,071,758) and differs. Proprietary cash flow statement (p8) not recorded (proprietary field is GAAP-only). Balance sheet: governmental lines from the governmental funds statement of assets and fund balances (p4; totals equal p1 governmental column), business-type lines from p1 business-type column; totals from p1 Total column. The only supplementary schedule is the unaudited all-funds budgetary comparison (p9), so detail is per fund column of the governmental funds statement (p5) and the proprietary fund statement (p7). Read pages 1-9 of 9"
}
